## Issue delivery handoff

<The accepted-members table is the authoritative candidate list; related
nonmembers are not closure targets. Give each member explicit, individually
checkable criteria. Implementation must evaluate every criterion and retain
resolved/partial/unresolved outcomes. This plan grants no closure authority.>

The maintainer may request implementation of this plan and closure of fully
resolved members after merge. Implement records local evidence; authorized PR
work adds closing references only after per-issue validation and a concise
verified comment. GitHub closes those issues on default-branch merge when
repository settings permit it. Partial or unverified issues remain open.

## Maintainer handoff

The maintainer implements, validates, commits, pushes and submits a PR through
the repository's workflow. This plan does not implement or publish the change,
schedule delivery, or certify completion.
